## **19.1 Un exemple de représentation unifiée**

```
data class VisionObservation(
    val id: String,
    val frameSequence: Long,
    val timestampNs: Long,
    val sourceFramework: VisionFramework,
    val sourceModel: String,
    val task: VisionTask,
    val quality: Float,
    val payload: ObservationPayload
)

sealed interface ObservationPayload {

    data class DetectionPayload(
        val detections: List<Detection>
    ) : ObservationPayload

    data class PosePayload(
        val poses: List<PoseObservation>
    ) : ObservationPayload

    data class DepthPayload(
        val depth: DepthObservation
